developer.yahoo.com/yui/"/></citation></ref><ref id="B10"><citation citation-type="other"><article-title>NIH Neuroscience Microarray Consortium </article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://arrayconsortium.tgen.org/"/></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>